                <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1__subsec-4">
                    <num>4</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>In making or revoking a call out order, the Governor-General is to act with the advice of <role refersTo="#minister">the Minister</role>.</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1__subsec-4A">
                    <num>4A</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>Before giving advice to the Governor-General in relation to the making or revoking of a call out order, <role refersTo="#minister">the Minister</role> must consult the Prime Minister.</p>
                    </content>
