                <content>
                  <p>Omit “<b>during call out</b>”, substitute “<b>w</b><b>hile covered by call out order</b>”.</p>
                </content>
              </hcontainer>
              <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-6">
