                </content>
              </hcontainer>
              <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-7">
                <num>7</num>
                <heading>Subsections 29(2), (3), (4) and (5)</heading>
                <content>
                  <p>Repeal the subsections, substitute:</p>
                </content>
                <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-7__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__part-1__amdact-1__item-7__qstr-1__subsec-2">
                    <num>2</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>Unless it ends earlier, and despite any specification by the Chief of the Defence Force, a period ends on the day on which the revocation of the call out order takes effect.</p>
                    </content>
                    <content>
                      <p>Other service not affected</p>
                    </content>
